<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>My First GitHub Page</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
      background-color: #f0f8ff;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 50px;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #2c3e50;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #34495e;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      background-color: #3498db;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
    }
    .button:hover {
      background-color: #2980b9;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Hello, World! 👋</h1>
  <p>Welcome to my first webpage hosted on GitHub Pages.</p>
  <a href="https://github.com" class="button">Visit GitHub</a>
</body>
</html>
